## DeepInfra (RAG + speech)

| Role | Default model ID | Env var | Wholesale unit |
|------|------------------|---------|----------------|
| Fast chat | `openai/gpt-oss-120b-Turbo` | `DEEPINFRA_CHAT_MODEL` | $0.15 in / $0.60 out per 1M **tokens** |
| Inference | `Qwen/Qwen3-32B` (build server) | `DEEPINFRA_INFERENCE_MODEL` | $0.08 in / $0.28 out per 1M **tokens** |
| Embeddings | `Qwen/Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B` | `DEEPINFRA_EMBEDDING_MODEL` | $0.01 per 1M **tokens** |
| Reranking | `Qwen/Qwen3-Reranker-0.6B` | `DEEPINFRA_RERANKER_MODEL` | $0.01 per 1M **tokens** |
| Speech-to-text | `mistralai/Voxtral-Mini-3B-2507` | `AI_SPEECH_MODEL` (ZAPI) | $0.00100 per **audio minute** |
| Text-to-speech | `canopylabs/orpheus-3b-0.1-ft` | `AI_TTS_MODEL` (ZAPI) | $7.00 per 1M **characters** |

- Chat: `POST ${DEEPINFRA_API_URL}/v1/openai/chat/completions`
- Embeddings: `POST ${DEEPINFRA_API_URL}/v1/openai/embeddings`
- Implement in `src/lib/deepinfra.ts` — `lib-canonical.mdc`

**DeepInfra rates are model-specific.** When any model ID changes, update the matching price env var to match [deepinfra.com/pricing](https://deepinfra.com/pricing). Do not reuse Qwen3-32B token rates for Voxtral or Orpheus.

