## Speech & TTS (Screen Recorder — ZAPI-hosted)

**Apps do not call Voxtral or Orpheus directly.** Proxy to ZAPI; ZAPI runs DeepInfra and bills via existing metering.

| App route (proxy) | ZAPI route | Model | Usage |
|-------------------|------------|-------|-------|
| `POST /apps/ai/transcribe` | storage key → Voxtral | Voxtral (`AI_SPEECH_MODEL`) | ASR — audio minutes (max 10 MB). Personal context bills the user. |
| `POST /apps/ai/vector-upsert` | vaultapi memories (namespaced `app:{app_code}`) | same embeddings as `/apps/ai/embeddings` | Isolated from Guide memories |
| `POST /apps/ai/vector-search` | vaultapi `/api/v1/memories/search` | embeddings | Filter + namespace by JWT user + `app_code` |
| `POST /apps/ai/vector-delete` | vaultapi `/api/v1/memories/delete` | — | Soft-delete companion |
| `POST …/transcribe` (screen recorder) | `POST /api/v1/groups/{gid}/screen-recordings/{id}/transcribe` | Voxtral (`AI_SPEECH_MODEL`) | ASR — audio minutes |
| `POST …/revoice` | `POST …/screen-recordings/{id}/revoice` | Orpheus (`AI_TTS_MODEL`) | TTS — characters |

ZAPI implementation: `deepinfra_speech.py`, `deepinfra_tts.py`, `screen_recording_billing.py`.

**Wholesale cost priority:**

1. DeepInfra `inference_status.cost` when returned (Voxtral JSON inference; Orpheus native inference endpoint)
2. Env estimate: `AI_SPEECH_USD_PER_MINUTE` × duration, or `AI_TTS_USD_PER_MILLION_CHARS` × character count

**ZAPI env** (`/opt/zeresoft/.env` on server1 — not app build inject):

| Variable | Default | Purpose |
|----------|---------|---------|
| `CREDITS_CHARGE_MULTIPLIER` | `2` | Markup on all metered usage |
| `AI_SPEECH_MODEL` | `mistralai/Voxtral-Mini-3B-2507` | STT model |
| `AI_SPEECH_USD_PER_MINUTE` | `0.00100` | Voxtral list price fallback |
| `AI_TTS_MODEL` | `canopylabs/orpheus-3b-0.1-ft` | TTS model |
| `AI_TTS_USD_PER_MILLION_CHARS` | `7.0` | Orpheus list price fallback |

Reference app: `~/apps/screenrecord` — proxies transcribe/revoice to ZAPI after media job is ready.

## RAG pipeline

**Docling → chunk → embed → store → retrieve → rerank → infer**

- Default chunk size: ~512 tokens, overlap ~64
- Store vectors in MongoDB unless the app specifies otherwise
- **docling** server-side only for PDFs/Office

## Docling

Parse uploads before chunking when layout, tables, or structure matter. Persist chunks in `{appshortname}_*` collections.
